# Section 7 image pin file — nonsecret, review-only template.
#
# Copy this to `images.env` (outside Git) and fill in the real GHCR digests.
# deploy.sh REFUSES any value that is not an immutable `image@sha256:…` digest,
# so a mutable tag (e.g. `:latest`) cannot accidentally become a production pin.
#
# Provide the approved immutable application image references (GHCR digests):
#   WEB_IMAGE=ghcr.io/<owner>/smshop-web@sha256:<digest>
#   API_IMAGE=ghcr.io/<owner>/smshop-api@sha256:<digest>
# `deploy.sh` refuses any value that is not an immutable `@sha256:` digest, so a
# mutable tag (e.g. `:latest`) cannot become a deployment pin. The current
# approved digests are recorded in docs/application-deployment-contract.md
# ("Published application images").
WEB_IMAGE=
API_IMAGE=
